@startuml
left to right direction

rectangle "Player\n玩家" as Player
rectangle "Enemy\n敵人" as Enemy
rectangle "GameManager\n管理分數與血量" as GameManager
rectangle "HUD\nScoreLabel / HealthHUD" as HUD
rectangle "RayCast2D\n平台邊緣偵測" as RayCast

Player -[hidden]-> GameManager
GameManager -[hidden]-> HUD
RayCast -[hidden]down-> Enemy

Enemy -right-> Player : a1 讀取位置 / 速度做攻擊與踩踏判定
Enemy -[hidden]right-> Player
Enemy --> Player : a2 攻擊時呼叫 take_damage
Player --> GameManager : a3 呼叫 set_health
GameManager --> HUD : a4 更新血量顯示

note right of Player
  攻擊分支
  a1 -> a2 -> a3 -> a4
end note

Player -left-> Enemy : a5 從上方踩中敵人
Enemy --> Player : a6 擊敗後呼叫 heal
Player --> GameManager : a7 呼叫 heal
GameManager --> HUD : a8 更新血量顯示

note right of GameManager
  踩踏分支
  a1 -> a5 -> a6 -> a7 -> a8
end note

RayCast --> Enemy : b1 回報前方是否有地板
Enemy --> Enemy : b2 依結果決定持續前進或轉向

legend right
  |= Flow |= 說明 |
  | a | 戰鬥流程，共用 a1，之後分成攻擊分支與踩踏分支 |
  | b | 敵人巡邏時的地板偵測與轉向流程 |
endlegend
@enduml
